{"title": "Soul Snare: Heal", "pageid": 28650, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Soul_Snare:_Heal", "categories": ["Class actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Soul_Snare_Heal.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Soul_Snare_Heal.webp/300px-Soul_Snare_Heal.webp, /w/images/e/e3/Soul_Snare_Heal.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Soul_Snare_Heal.webp/300px-Soul_Snare_Heal.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Soul_Snare_Heal.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Soul Snare: Heal</b> is a free action granted by the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gloves_of_Soul_Catching\" title=\"Gloves of Soul Catching\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Gloves_of_Soul_Catching_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Gloves_of_Soul_Catching_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Gloves_of_Soul_Catching_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_of_Soul_Catching_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Gloves_of_Soul_Catching_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Gloves_of_Soul_Catching_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Gloves_of_Soul_Catching_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Gloves_of_Soul_Catching_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/11/Gloves_of_Soul_Catching_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gloves_of_Soul_Catching\" title=\"Gloves of Soul Catching\">Gloves of Soul Catching</a> after landing an unarmed strike. It heals the wearer <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">10</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/30px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/40px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hit Points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Hit Points</span></a>.\n<p>This action is mutually exclusive with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Soul_Catching_Boon\" title=\"Soul Catching Boon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Generic_Buff_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Buff_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Generic_Buff_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Buff_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Generic_Buff_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Buff_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Soul Catching Boon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Generic_Buff_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Buff_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d6/Generic_Buff_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Soul_Catching_Boon\" title=\"Soul Catching Boon\">Soul Catching Boon</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Soul_Catching_Prowess\" title=\"Soul Catching Prowess\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dd/Soul_Catching_Prowess_Icon.webp/20px-Soul_Catching_Prowess_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/dd/Soul_Catching_Prowess_Icon.webp/30px-Soul_Catching_Prowess_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/dd/Soul_Catching_Prowess_Icon.webp/40px-Soul_Catching_Prowess_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Soul Catching Prowess\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dd/Soul_Catching_Prowess_Icon.webp/20px-Soul_Catching_Prowess_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/dd/Soul_Catching_Prowess_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Soul_Catching_Prowess\" title=\"Soul Catching Prowess\">Soul Catching Prowess</a>. Only one of these three <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Soul_Catching\" title=\"Soul Catching\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Soul Catching\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Soul_Catching\" title=\"Soul Catching\">Soul Catching</a> features can be used in a single turn.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nHeal <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">10</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/30px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/40px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hit Points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Hit Points</span></a> from catching a soul.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dt>Healing: 10</dt><dd class=\"bg3wiki-damage-display\" style=\"margin-left:0px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;width:fit-content\"><div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">10</span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/30px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/40px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Healing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Healing</span></a></div></div></div></dd>\n<dl><dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: Self\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: Self</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Per turn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: Per turn</dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_MAG_SoulCatching_Heal</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_MAG_SoulCatching_Heal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_MAG_SoulCatching_Heal\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_(spell_flag)\" title=\"Temporary (spell flag)\">Temporary</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by items:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gloves_of_Soul_Catching\" title=\"Gloves of Soul Catching\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Gloves_of_Soul_Catching_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_of_Soul_Catching_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Gloves_of_Soul_Catching_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Gloves_of_Soul_Catching_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Gloves_of_Soul_Catching_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Gloves_of_Soul_Catching_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Gloves_of_Soul_Catching_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_of_Soul_Catching_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/11/Gloves_of_Soul_Catching_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Gloves_of_Soul_Catching\" title=\"Gloves of Soul Catching\">Gloves of Soul Catching</a></span> </li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>When this action is used, the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Grasp_Essence_(Condition)\" title=\"Grasp Essence (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Grasp Essence\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Grasp_Essence_(Condition)\" title=\"Grasp Essence (Condition)\">Grasp Essence</a> condition is removed. This prevents using any of the three <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Soul_Catching\" title=\"Soul Catching\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Soul Catching\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Soul_Catching\" title=\"Soul Catching\">Soul Catching</a> features again until the following turn when Grasp Essence can be regained.</li>\n<li>The tooltip of this ability indicates that it applies the <a href=\"/wiki/Dash_(Condition)\" title=\"Dash (Condition)\">Dash</a> condition as well, but it only seems to heal as intended.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201238\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.101 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.107 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4522/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 55763/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 20691/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 34/1000\nLua time usage: 0.045/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1273967/52428800 byt